ow/133198569.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/why-putins-first-kuril-islands-visit-matters-as-russia-japan-ties-hit-new-low/articleshow/133198569.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T11:03:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133199199,imgsize-64526.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[280,000 trees transform New Zealand island into conservation sanctuary]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133161170.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/how-280000-volunteer-planted-trees-transformed-new-zealands-tiritiri-matangi-from-a-degraded-island-into-a-conservation-sanctuary/articleshow/133161170.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/how-280000-volunteer-planted-trees-transformed-new-zealands-tiritiri-matangi-from-a-degraded-island-into-a-conservation-sanctuary/articleshow/133161170.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T11:05:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133161296,imgsize-250248.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Dogs can read human emotions! Scientists want you to smile]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133177993.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[New research confirms dogs can differentiate human emotions through facial expressions.  Their brains process happy faces in a unique reward region, showing emotional significance.  Dogs also distinguish between fear, anger, and sadness with distinct brain activity patterns.  This ability developed through domestication, aiding their social understanding of humans.  Understanding these emotions does not mean dogs experience them identically to people.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/dog-parents-you-were-right-all-along-scientists-finally-find-dogs-can-tell-when-youre-sad-scared-or-angry-heres-why-they-want-you-to-smile/articleshow/133177993.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/dog-parents-you-were-right-all-along-scientists-finally-find-dogs-can-tell-when-youre-sad-scared-or-angry-heres-why-they-want-you-to-smile/articleshow/133177993.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T15:40:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133178114,imgsize-209075.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Leavitt to leave White House podium to become MAGA warrior mom]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133198708.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/leavitt-to-leave-white-house-podium-to-become-maga-warrior-mom/articleshow/133198708.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/leavitt-to-leave-white-house-podium-to-become-maga-warrior-mom/articleshow/133198708.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T10:46:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Chidanand Rajghatta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133198741,imgsize-82678.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Potatoes 'boiling' in ground, livestock dead: Record heat ruins harvest in South Korea, Japan, Hong Kong]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatime