20-million-to-remove-illegal-aliens-from-us-sparks-outrage/articleshow/133197164.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ice-agents-to-get-electric-shock-gloves-worth-20-million-to-remove-illegal-aliens-from-us-sparks-outrage/articleshow/133197164.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T09:26:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133197359,imgsize-125334.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Bubba Smith: "Well, I'm not a violent person. You have to back off. People sometimes will…"]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133197545.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-bubba-smith-well-im-not-a-violent-person-you-have-to-back-off-people-sometimes-will-a-lesson-in-restraint-self-control-and-knowing-when-to-step-back/articleshow/133197545.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-bubba-smith-well-im-not-a-violent-person-you-have-to-back-off-people-sometimes-will-a-lesson-in-restraint-self-control-and-knowing-when-to-step-back/articleshow/133197545.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T10:15:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133198126,imgsize-46279.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US attack on Yemen killed 153 civilians in April 2025: Pentagon review]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133197963.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-attack-on-yemen-killed-153-civilians-in-april-2025-pentagon-review/articleshow/133197963.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-attack-on-yemen-killed-153-civilians-in-april-2025-pentagon-review/articleshow/133197963.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T10:13:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133199062,imgsize-115014.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[In 1960, 2-day-old David Stevenson was found abandoned; 66 years later, he finds his family]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133188402.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[David Stevenson, who was found abandoned as a two-day-old baby in a London flats corridor in 1960, has finally discovered his biological family more than six decades later. Appearing on This Morning, David opened up about his emotional search, meeting his relatives in the Netherlands and learning more about his biological mother, Petra.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/people/in-1960-2-day-old-baby-david-stevenson-was-found-abandoned-in-a-london-flats-corridor-66-years-later-he-finally-discovers-his-biological-family/articleshow/133188402.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/life-style/people/in-1960-2-day-old-baby-david-stevenson-was-found-abandoned-in-a-london-flats-corridor-66-years-later-he-finally-discovers-his-biological-family/articleshow/133188402.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-12T22:13:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133188486,imgsize-62572.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Missile threat made Trump move to smaller US jet during Turkey visit: Report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133196786.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[US President Trump was secretly moved to a smaller aircraft due to a missile threat. This extraordinary security operation occurred during his return from Turkey last month. The larger presidential plane was used as a decoy while he traveled separately. Secret Service acted on credible and imminent intelligence regarding the danger. The operation remained secret to conceal the president's movements from potential attackers.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/missile-threat-made-donald-trump-move-to-smaller-us-jet-during-turkey-visit-report/articleshow/133196786.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/missile-threat-made-donald-trump-move-to-smaller-us-jet-during-turkey-visit-report/articleshow/133196786.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T09:02:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133196827,imgsize-66794.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Virginia rebuilt 1.09 miles of shoreline, creating new marsh and oyster reef in Chesapeake Bay]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133194062.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Virginia’s $8 million Ragged Island restoration project rebuilt 1.09 miles of shoreline, creating 2.6 acres of marsh and 2.2 acres of oyster reef. Funded by NOAA Fisheries, the project is reducing erosion and keeping hundreds of tons of sediment and nutrients out of Chesapeake Bay while creating valuable habitat for fish, crabs and birds.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-virginia-spent-8-million-rebuilding-1-09-miles-of-ragged-island-shoreline-the-project-created-2-6-acres-of-new-marsh-and-2-2-acres-of-oyster-reef-while-cutting-hundreds-of-tons-of-sediment-entering-chesapeake-bay/articleshow/133194062.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2025-virginia-spent-8-million-rebuilding-1-09-miles-of-ragged-island-shoreline-the-project-created-2-6-acres-of-new-marsh-and-2-2-acres-of-oyster-reef-while-cutting-hundreds-of-tons-of-sediment-entering-chesapeake-bay/articleshow/133194062.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T03:52:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133195057,imgsize-160183.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Louisiana creates 1,170 acres of wetlands; shrimp and crabs return to restored habitat after a year]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192949.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Louisiana’s Upper Barataria Marsh Creation Project has restored 1,170 acres of new wetland habitat in the Barataria Basin. One year after construction, white and brown shrimp, blue crab and red drum are using the restored marsh and water features. The project aims to rebuild coastal ecosystems damaged by decades of land loss and the Deepwater Horizon oil spill.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/louisiana-created-1170-acres-of-new-wetlands-in-barataria-basin-one-year-later-shrimp-and-crabs-are-returning-to-the-restored-habitat/articleshow/133192949.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/louisiana-created-1170-acres-of-new-wetlands-in-barataria-basin-one-year-later-shrimp-and-crabs-are-returning-to-the-restored-habitat/articleshow/133192949.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T02:52:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192954,imgsize-146005.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ex-Chinese Premier Zhu Rongji, who drove economic reforms &amp; led China into the WTO, dies at 97]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133196025.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/ex-chinese-premier-zhu-rongji-who-drove-economic-reforms-and-led-china-into-the-wto-dies-at-97/articleshow/133196025.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/ex-chinese-premier-zhu-rongji-who-drove-economic-reforms-and-led-china-into-the-wto-dies-at-97/articleshow/133196025.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T07:55:13+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133196056,imgsize-68268.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[30 senators flag delays in US visa appointments for Indian students]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133196005.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/30-senators-flag-delays-in-us-visa-appointments-for-indian-students/articleshow/133196005.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/30-senators-flag-delays-in-us-visa-appointments-for-indian-students/articleshow/133196005.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T07:51:14+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133196019,imgsize-38934.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Will start seizing EU vessels if bloc targets Russian ships, says Putin]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133195926.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/will-start-seizing-eu-vessels-if-bloc-targets-russian-ships-says-putin/articleshow/133195926.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/will-start-seizing-eu-vessels-if-bloc-targets-russian-ships-says-putin/articleshow/133195926.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T07:41:37+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133195934,imgsize-55184.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ferry overturns in Zimbabwe lake killing at least 44]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133195942.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/ferry-overturns-in-zimbabwe-lake-killing-at-least-44/articleshow/133195942.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/ferry-overturns-in-zimbabwe-lake-killing-at-least-44/articleshow/133195942.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T07:46:48+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133195971,imgsize-42492.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote by Voltaire: 'Life is a shipwreck, but we must not forget to sing in the lifeboats']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192730.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Life often throws insurmountable challenges our way, yet how we respond is within our control. A saying mistakenly linked to Voltaire beautifully encapsulates this spirit of resilience. This notion complements Viktor Frankl's concept of tragic optimism, proposing that we can find joy amid adversity. Embracing radical acceptance allows us to confront our circumstances, paving the way to discover meaning and happiness even in the darkest times.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-inspired-by-voltaire-life-is-a-shipwreck-but-we-must-not-forget-to-sing-in-the-lifeboats-and-why-choosing-joy-in-the-face-of-chaos-may-be-the-ultimate-act-of-defiance/articleshow/133192730.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-inspired-by-voltaire-life-is-a-shipwreck-but-we-must-not-forget-to-sing-in-the-lifeboats-and-why-choosing-joy-in-the-face-of-chaos-may-be-the-ultimate-act-of-defiance/articleshow/133192730.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T02:00:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192881,imgsize-1023937.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote of the day by Zohran Mamdani: 'For generation after generation, we have been told that when the world has sent its people to our shores, it has not sent its best']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192786.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-zohran-mamdani-for-generation-after-generation-we-have-been-told-that-when-the-world-has-sent-its-people-to-our-shores-it-has-not-sent-its-best/articleshow/133192786.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/quote-of-the-day-by-zohran-mamdani-for-generation-after-generation-we-have-been-told-that-when-the-world-has-sent-its-people-to-our-shores-it-has-not-sent-its-best/articleshow/133192786.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T01:33:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192801,imgsize-707024.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Quote by Montesquieu: 'Success of most things depends upon knowing how long it will take to succeed']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133192668.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Jeff Bezos led Amazon by prioritizing a long-term vision rather than chasing short-term gains. This perspective aligns with Montesquieu's philosophy that success is often a lengthy journey. Misjudging project timeframes can lead to distress and hasty strategy changes. Insights from modern behavioral science highlight the planning fallacy and sunk cost biases. To excel in any domain, it is crucial to accurately grasp how long true mastery takes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-montesquieu-the-success-of-most-things-depends-upon-knowing-how-long-it-will-take-to-succeed-and-why-we-give-up-on-our-biggest-goals-too-soon/articleshow/133192668.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/quote-of-the-day-by-montesquieu-the-success-of-most-things-depends-upon-knowing-how-long-it-will-take-to-succeed-and-why-we-give-up-on-our-biggest-goals-too-soon/articleshow/133192668.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-13T01:20:45+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133192711,imgsize-852378.cms"/></item></channel></rss>